@startuml
title Figure 5.2: Sequence Diagram of the Test Environment Setup (component level).
participant "Vue\n(Import.vue)" as Vue
participant "Rust Core\n(env.rs)" as Rust
participant "Python Engine\n(venv / pip)" as Py
database "SQLite\n(projects)" as DB

Vue -> Rust: validate_project_directory(path)
Rust --> Vue: validation result
Vue -> Rust: detect_python_env(path)
Rust --> Vue: {pythonPath, pythonVersion, venvExists, dependencies}

alt no venv
    Vue -> Rust: create_virtual_env(path)
    Rust -> Py: python -m venv .venv
    Py --> Rust: status
end

loop missing dependencies
    Vue -> Rust: install_dependencies(packages)
    Rust -> Py: pip install <pkg>
    Rust --> Vue: event install_step
end

Vue -> Rust: add_project(name, path, interpreterPath)
Rust -> DB: INSERT projects (UNIQUE project_path)
DB --> Rust: id
Rust --> Vue: project id
@enduml
